Z||000020||MrPBody||01-02-2001||04:54 PM||||See above.  I recommend cutting 1 coil from front and 1/2 coil from rear; then see how you like the ride and handling.  If it's not low enough, cut a little more.  Just my opinion; take it with a grain of salt.<BR>||||reg||1
